  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>수업의도: 최신 과학동향을 알려주고 싶어소.</p><p>방&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; 법: 구글과제로 과학기사 제공 후 요약&#160;&#160;&amp; 자신의 생각을 적도록 지도하고 피드백.</p><p>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;온라인 수업이 있을 때마다 한 주에 한번씩 해 보고자 함.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f8873e878644e6e06f33408d3ef084d6ec920a5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f8873e878644e6e06f33408d3ef084d6ec920a5\" data-orgin-width=\"1452\" data-origin-height=\"596\"><div class=\"figcaption\">&lt;하이퍼 루프&gt;</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1fcdf6a95066ae8aa5a82e51504fd99d52d8dc85\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1fcdf6a95066ae8aa5a82e51504fd99d52d8dc85\" data-orgin-width=\"1498\" data-origin-height=\"579\"></div><p>교체용 배터리 전기차에 대한 기사글에 대해 제출한 글.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
